  "Each file follows its nearest project, so one class can resolve differently per app.": "每個檔案跟隨最近的專案，同一個 class 在不同 app 可以解析成不同的值。",
  "Change a token and compare snapshots to see the classes, files and outputs it reaches.": "修改 token 後比對 snapshot，就能看到它影響的 class、檔案與輸出。",
  "CLI": "CLI",
  "Button": "按鈕",
  "Themes, tokens, wide-gamut color, layout and motion are all written as classes, and the CSS they generate stays predictable.": "主題、token、廣色域色彩、版面與動態都寫成 class，產生的 CSS 也始終可預期。",
  "The language service completes classes from your manifest, shows the CSS behind each class on hover and marks colors in place.": "語言服務依你的 manifest 補全 class，hover 時顯示每個 class 背後的 CSS，並直接標出顏色。",
  "Ship static CSS by default, pre-render it into HTML or generate it in the browser. Your classes stay the same.": "預設輸出靜態 CSS，也可以預先渲染進 HTML，或在瀏覽器中產生；你的 class 都不用改。",
  "The total CSS each documentation page delivers, measured raw and with Brotli. Master CSS ships only the rules a page uses.": "每個文件頁實際載入的 CSS 總量，分別以原始大小與 Brotli 壓縮計算。Master CSS 只載入頁面用到的規則。",
  "ESLint in your editor, the CLI in your scripts and the MCP server for agents check classes with the same rules and fixes.": "編輯器裡的 ESLint、腳本中的 CLI，以及給 agent 的 MCP 伺服器，都用同一套規則與修正檢查 class。",
  "The MCP server gives coding agents your manifest and lint rules, so they check their own edits and hand you fixes as diffs.": "MCP 伺服器把你的 manifest 與 lint 規則交給 coding agent，讓它們檢查自己的修改，並以 diff 交給你修正。",
  "One project manifest drives the CSS of every integration, monorepo app and route, and a snapshot comparison shows what a change touches.": "一份專案 manifest 驅動每個整合、monorepo app 與路由的 CSS，snapshot 比對則顯示一次變更觸及哪些地方。",
  "Modes swap token values, not class names. Drag the divider to see which value is in use.": "模式切換的是 token 值，不是 class 名稱。拖曳分隔線，看看目前用的是哪個值。",
  "Define color, spacing, radius and type once in @theme; utilities, components and modes all read from them.": "在 @theme 定義一次顏色、間距、圓角與字體，utilities、元件與模式都從這裡讀取。",
  "Grid spans, responsive layouts, animation and view transitions, written right beside the markup they style.": "Grid span、響應式版面、動畫與 view transition，直接寫在它們所設定的 markup 旁。",
  "Utilities sit in a later layer than components, so a class in markup wins without !important.": "Utilities 位在比元件更後面的 layer，markup 裡的 class 不需要 !important 就能生效。",
  "P3 palettes on a predictable tier scale, from deep anchors to bright accents beyond sRGB.": "P3 色盤採用可預期的色階，從深色基調到超出 sRGB 的明亮強調色。",
  "Scan classes at build time and ship a plain stylesheet, with no runtime in the browser.": "建置時掃描 class 並輸出一般樣式表，瀏覽器裡不需要 runtime。",
  "Render first-load CSS into the page; the runtime starts its engine only for classes outside it.": "把首次載入的 CSS 渲染進頁面；只有遇到其中沒有的 class，runtime 才會啟動引擎。",
  "Generate rules in the browser as classes appear, from editors, CMS content or playgrounds.": "在瀏覽器中隨 class 出現即時產生規則，適合編輯器、CMS 內容或 playground。",
  "Every framework integration and the CLI load the same project manifest, so builds and editors agree.": "每個框架整合與 CLI 都載入同一份專案 manifest，建置與編輯器的結果因此一致。",
  "Style in markup with class names and design tokens. One project manifest generates only the CSS each page uses, and checks every class the same way in your editor, your build and your AI agents.": "直接在 markup 裡用 class 名稱與設計 token 撰寫樣式。一份專案 manifest 只產生每頁實際用到的 CSS，並在編輯器、建置流程與 AI agent 中以同一套規則檢查每個 class。",
  "A markup-driven CSS orchestration language for developers and AI agents.": "以 markup 驅動、為開發者與 AI agent 打造的 CSS 編排語言。",
